OL,3,GNEWSABradford Uni at 60: Peace Studies,
OL,4,Aprotests and Pink Floyd
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the 1960s, Britain's higher
OL,7,Feducation sector underwent a revolution
OL,8,Fas the number of universities more than
OL,9,Fdoubled and access to degree courses
OL,10,Fwas widened - and as part of that
OL,11,Frevolution, the University of Bradford,
OL,12,Fwhich is now celebrating its 60th
OL,13,Fanniversary, was founded.
OL,15,FBefore it became one of the new
OL,16,Fso-called "plate glass" universities
OL,17,Fthat were symbols of a time of social
OL,18,Fmobility, the institution had been a
OL,19,Ftechnical college and had its roots in
OL,20,Fthe education of textile workers in
OL,21,FBradford's many mills.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
