OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABradford Uni at 60: Peace Studies,
OL,4,Aprotests and Pink Floyd
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, in 1966, the year England famously
OL,7,Fwon the World Cup, the University of
OL,8,FBradford opened its doors for the first
OL,9,Ftime, with Prime Minister Harold Wilson
OL,10,Fas its chancellor.
OL,12,FIt went on to see the founding of the
OL,13,Ffirst ever School of Peace Studies in
OL,14,F1974; it was the jumping off point for
OL,15,Ffuture politicians such as Gavin
OL,16,FWilliamson, Clive Lewis and Michael
OL,17,FMeadowcroft; and Felicia Hwang Yi Xin
OL,18,Fstudied there before going on to become
OL,19,FMiss International Indonesia in 2016.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
